{"seq":4,"slug":"state-persistence","title":"状态持久化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/vue-in-depth/state-management/state-persistence","wordCount":677,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"状态持久化\">状态持久化</h1><h2 id=\"为什么需要持久化\">为什么需要持久化</h2><p>单页应用（SPA）中的状态默认存储在内存中，页面刷新后即丢失。对于用户偏好、登录令牌、表单草稿等数据，需要将状态持久化到浏览器存储中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    State[&quot;内存状态&quot;]&#10;    State --&gt; |持久化| Storage[&quot;浏览器存储&quot;]&#10;    Storage --&gt; |恢复| State&#10;    subgraph StorageTypes[&quot;存储类型&quot;]&#10;        LS[&quot;localStorage&lt;br/&gt;永久存储&quot;]&#10;        SS[&quot;sessionStorage&lt;br/&gt;会话存储&quot;]&#10;        IDB[&quot;IndexedDB&lt;br/&gt;大数据量&quot;]&#10;        CK[&quot;Cookie&lt;br/&gt;服务端可读&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    State[\"内存状态\"]\n    State --&gt; |持久化| Storage[\"浏览器存储\"]\n    Storage --&gt; |恢复| State\n    subgraph StorageTypes[\"存储类型\"]\n        LS[\"localStorage&lt;br/&gt;永久存储\"]\n        SS[\"sessionStorage&lt;br/&gt;会话存储\"]\n        IDB[\"IndexedDB&lt;br/&gt;大数据量\"]\n        CK[\"Cookie&lt;br/&gt;服务端可读\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>持久化</strong>：把内存中的状态写入浏览器存储，使页面刷新或会话重开后仍能恢复——本质是内存与存储之间的双向同步。</li>\n<li><strong>存储介质</strong>：<code>localStorage</code>、<code>sessionStorage</code>、<code>IndexedDB</code>、<code>Cookie</code> 四者容量、生命周期与是否对服务端可见各不相同。</li>\n<li><strong>声明式配置</strong>：<code>pinia-plugin-persistedstate</code> 通过 <code>persist</code> 选项描述存什么、存到哪、如何序列化，替代手写 watch 同步。</li>\n<li><strong>字段筛选</strong>：<code>pick</code> 只持久化必要字段，避免把冗余或敏感数据落到存储中。</li>\n<li><strong>Hydration（注水）</strong>：SSR 场景下把服务端序列化的状态注入客户端实例，使两端渲染一致。</li>\n<li><strong>自定义序列化</strong>：通过 <code>serializer</code> 控制编解码，可为敏感字段叠加加密。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"存储方式对比\">存储方式对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n<th>容量</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th align=\"center\">可被服务端读取</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>localStorage</code></td>\n<td>~5-10MB</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td align=\"center\">❌</td>\n<td>用户设置、主题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sessionStorage</code></td>\n<td>~5-10MB</td>\n<td>当前会话</td>\n<td align=\"center\">❌</td>\n<td>表单草稿、临时状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IndexedDB</code></td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td align=\"center\">❌</td>\n<td>大型离线数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Cookie</code></td>\n<td>~4KB</td>\n<td>可设置过期</td>\n<td align=\"center\">✅</td>\n<td>认证令牌</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"手动实现持久化\">手动实现持久化</h2><h3 id=\"基础方案\">基础方案</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// composables/usePersistedRef.ts&#10;import { ref, watch, type Ref } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;&#10;export function usePersistedRef&lt;T&gt;(key: string, defaultValue: T, storage: Storage = localStorage): Ref&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  const stored = storage.getItem(key);&#10;  const data = ref&lt;T&gt;(stored ? JSON.parse(stored) : defaultValue) as Ref&lt;T&gt;;&#10;&#10;  watch(&#10;    data,&#10;    (newValue) =&gt; {&#10;      storage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(newValue));&#10;    },&#10;    { deep: true },&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return data;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// composables/usePersistedRef.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ref, watch, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Ref } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> usePersistedRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">defaultValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">storage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Storage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> localStorage)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stored</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(stored </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(stored) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> defaultValue) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  watch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">newValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      storage.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stringify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(newValue));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { deep: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"vue\" data-code=\"&lt;script setup lang=&quot;ts&quot;&gt;&#10;import { usePersistedRef } from &#39;@/composables/usePersistedRef&#39;;&#10;&#10;const settings = usePersistedRef(&#39;user-settings&#39;, {&#10;  theme: &#39;light&#39; as &#39;light&#39; | &#39;dark&#39;,&#10;  fontSize: 14,&#10;  language: &#39;zh-CN&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&lt;/script&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;template&gt;&#10;  &lt;select v-model=&quot;settings.theme&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;option value=&quot;light&quot;&gt;浅色&lt;/option&gt;&#10;    &lt;option value=&quot;dark&quot;&gt;深色&lt;/option&gt;&#10;  &lt;/select&gt;&#10;&lt;/template&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;script setup lang=\"ts\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { usePersistedRef } from '@/composables/usePersistedRef';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const settings = usePersistedRef('user-settings', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  theme: 'light' as 'light' | 'dark',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fontSize: 14,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  language: 'zh-CN',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/script></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;template></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;select v-model=\"settings.theme\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;option value=\"light\">浅色&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;option value=\"dark\">深色&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  &#x3C;/select></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/template></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"pinia-plugin-persistedstate\">pinia-plugin-persistedstate</h2><p>这是 Pinia 生态中最流行的持久化插件，提供声明式配置：</p>\n<h3 id=\"安装和配置\">安装和配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// main.ts&#10;import { createApp } from &#39;vue&#39;;&#10;import { createPinia } from &#39;pinia&#39;;&#10;import piniaPluginPersistedstate from &#39;pinia-plugin-persistedstate&#39;;&#10;&#10;const pinia = createPinia();&#10;pinia.use(piniaPluginPersistedstate);&#10;&#10;createApp(App).use(pinia).mount(&#39;#app&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createApp } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'vue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createPinia } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pinia'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> piniaPluginPersistedstate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pinia-plugin-persistedstate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pinia</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createPinia</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pinia.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(piniaPluginPersistedstate);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createApp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(App).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pinia).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#app'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基本使用\">基本使用</h3><di